  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Initializes the strategy.\\n\\n`asset` is the underlying (USDC). `init_args` (11, in order):\\n0. `rwa_asset: Address`\\n1. `aqua_router: Address`\\n2. `aqua_tokens: Vec<Address>` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the pool's token set, sorted ascending by address\\n3. `aqua_pool_index: BytesN<32>`\\n4. `oracle: Address` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 SEP-40 price feed for `rwa_asset`\\n5. `keeper: Address`\\n6. `max_deposit: i128` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 per-tx cap (USDC)\\n7. `max_tvl: i128` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 strategy NAV cap (USDC)\\n8. `max_spread_bps: u32` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 oracle/Aqua disagreement tolerance\\n9. `quote_ttl_seconds: u64` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 oracle staleness window\\n10. `slippage_bps: u32` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 execution slippage tolerance\\n\\nConstruction-time panics (`.expect(...)` on a missing/malformed `init_args` slot,\\n`assert!` on an out-of-range value) are deliberate: they abort a bad deploy before any\\nstate is persisted, rather than leaving the strategy live with an invalid `Config`.",
      "name": "__constructor",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "asset",
          "type_": "address"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "init_args",
          "type_": {
            "vec": {
              "element_type": "val"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": []
    }
  },
